{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n    \"In contrast, changes in the M1 alpha power and M1-STN alpha coherence in the TurnPre and TurnStart phase did not show significant predictive value (Fig. 4C, D), indicating a more localized role of PMC and its connectivity in freezing behavior.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n    \"M1 alpha power changes and D M1-STN coherence changes during the TurnPre or TurnStart phase relative to walking do not significantly correlate with freezing duration.\",\n    \"Importantly, increases in the PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确区分了两个结果：第一，PMC-STN alpha coherence 在 TurnPre 阶段具有显著预测价值（β=0.205，p=0.006）；第二，M1-STN alpha coherence 在 TurnPre 和 TurnStart 阶段均未显示显著预测价值。因此，指控者对原文研究结果的描述有明确、直接的全文依据，judge_supported 应为 yes。需要区分的是，附件只有论文全文，没有提供被指控的另一份研究报告，因此无法独立核实该报告是否确实遗漏了阳性结果或混淆了两个结果。报告说法中关于论文存在这一阳性结果及相应阴性结果的部分有依据，但关于报告实际遗漏或误读的部分无法仅凭论文确认，故整体判为 partly。另一个重要限定是，论文图4图注明确指出 PMC-STN TurnPre coherence 预测的是较短的冻结发作持续时间；其预测关系来自本文的试次内线性混合效应模型，不应进一步夸大为已经验证的临床外部预测效能。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "31b78f3a-6eb0-4e8b-a385-99a1e0fd2ced", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T115642977882Z", "elapsed_seconds": 129.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:58:52.753842+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c749ab3e8fb7bc18f9b47fd5885adb9a57bb32ae3f3bdb9455a1a14e0477ea3c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T115642977882Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dd48f15d5b7cfd41b2bf4769f4b7d86cf03c50c21140ba885df30008597db10f"}}}
